name: Erratic Diamonds Spike — many Diamonds
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 20 Diamonds, a suit spike for Flush lines,
  Greedy Joker, Rough Gem, and Smeared Joker pivots. RAG aliases: erratic diamonds,
  all Diamonds, diamond flush seed, money gem build, red suit pile.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticSuit: Diamonds
    min: 20
should:
  - joker: RoughGem
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 55
  - joker: GreedyJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    label: "Combines Diamonds and Hearts into red-suit support"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: TheTribe
    label: "Flush payoff from Diamond density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
